# vm.swappiness weighs swap against file-page reclaim on a 0-200 scale, and at 0
# the kernel does not swap until free plus file-backed pages fall below the
# zone high watermark (https://docs.kernel.org/admin-guide/sysctl/vm.html#swappiness).
